# vehje-ir — backlog

## Span de-duplication via interning

Files with many same-span references waste memory. A future round
can intern spans into a shared table, with Span becoming a u32
handle. Defer until profiling surfaces the waste.

## Type-safe NodeId<T>

Current NodeId is untyped — any NodeId can be passed to any
consumer. Type-safe variants (NodeId<Expr>, NodeId<Pat>, etc.)
would catch cross-kind misuse at compile time but add friction.
Defer until a consumer surfaces the need.

## Severity widening

Current Severity enum: Error / Warning / Info / Help. May need
to grow: Fatal (abort immediately), Lint (separate from Warning
for downstream filtering). Defer until consumer surfaces.
